      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.61,
      "end_seconds": 75.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "No, none, no diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.6,
      "end_seconds": 85.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "So, a few quick ones: fever, recent injury or recent cut?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.73,
      "end_seconds": 91.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "No, um, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.01,
      "end_seconds": 96.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Okay, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.27,
      "end_seconds": 103.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.08,
      "end_seconds": 120.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.23,
      "end_seconds": 126.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Hmm, nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.87,
      "end_seconds": 130.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.85,
      "end_seconds": 144.03,
      "duration_seconds": 12.18,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days. I walk the dog every morning. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.99,
      "end_seconds": 153.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.25,
      "end_seconds": 159.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Okay, so no, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.24,
      "end_seconds": 163.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.67,
      "end_seconds": 165.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.61,
      "end_seconds": 171.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.02,
      "end_seconds": 181.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.5,
      "end_seconds": 210.6,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 76, temperature 36.8, oxygen saturation is 98 percent. And respiratory rate 17, pressure 124 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.47,
      "end_seconds": 215.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.19,
      "end_seconds": 227.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.64,
      "end_seconds": 230.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.09,
      "end_seconds": 250.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "The ulcer has a ragged purple edge with a boggy base and undermined borders."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.43,
      "end_seconds": 258.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.46,
      "end_seconds": 280.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? This is probably possible pyoderma gangrenosum linked to bowel inflammation."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.0,
      "end_seconds": 284.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.51,
      "end_seconds": 311.27,
      "duration_seconds": 25.76,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now possible pyoderma gangrenosum linked to bowel inflammation is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's book a skin biopsy to look into rapidly enlarging ulcer. Do not cut or scrub it, that can make it worse. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.19,
      "end_seconds": 316.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "I, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
